# ADR output templates (11 §11.0, PLAN-M6.md T5): YAML front matter interleaved with Handlebars
# block helpers (#each/#if), not ordinary prose. A critic round found prettier's own markdown
# formatter (matched by the plain .md extension prefix) reflows and merges these files' own
# deliberate line structure -- collapsing distinct YAML keys onto one line and merging Handlebars
# block boundaries with surrounding text, silently corrupting both the YAML and the template's own
# control flow. Excluded outright rather than fixed per-file: prettier has no markdown-aware mode
# for "YAML plus Handlebars," and reformatting would reintroduce the identical corruption on the
# next `prettier --write .`.
packages/templates/templates/adr-*.md.hbs
